ATTRIBUTION NOTICE:

DDT Custom Discord Client contains modifications and enhancements to the 
original Vencord codebase. The following components are original DDT work:

- API Inspector Plugin
- Event Logger Plugin  
- Network Inspector Plugin
- Token Manager Plugin
- Developer Theme Plugin
- Dev Tools Panel Plugin
- DDT Quest Automator Plugin
- Core branding modifications ([DDT] logger, UI changes)
- All UserPlugins Over 290+


